@startuml
title 不透明PBRと透明PBRが共有する照明計算
top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam defaultFontName Yu Gothic UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 18
skinparam rectangle {
  RoundCorner 24
  BorderColor black
  BackgroundColor #f7fbff
}
rectangle "PbrBrdf.js\nGGX・Smith・Schlick・Lambert・IBL" as BRDF #f4edff
rectangle "不透明Shape" as Opaque #eaf7e8
rectangle "GeometryBufferPass\nPBR G-buffer" as GBuffer
rectangle "DeferredLightingPass\n画素ごとにPBR照明" as Deferred #fdeaea
rectangle "透明Shape" as Transparent #eaf7e8
rectangle "PbrForwardShader\nfragmentごとにPBR照明" as Forward #fdeaea
rectangle "線形HDRシーン\n不透明と透明を統合" as HDR
Opaque --> GBuffer
GBuffer --> Deferred
BRDF --> Deferred
Transparent --> Forward
BRDF --> Forward
Deferred --> HDR
Forward --> HDR
note right of GBuffer
一画素に最前面の不透明surfaceを保存
透明layerは後段Forwardへ送る
end note
@enduml
